  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Insitutionellt samarbete mellan Swedish Water Development och Krakows VA-verk inom &#xe4;mnesomr&#xe5;den: slamhantering, kommunikation med  medborgare,   vattenkvalitet och kvalitetss&#xe4;kring.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The project is an institutional cooperation between the Water and Sewage Company in Krakow, Poland and Swedish Water Development (SWD). The aim is to find ways of solving three interrelated problems in Krakow: handling of sludge, communication with citizens, and water quality.</narrative>
  </description>
